it agrees with the already\nexisting notion defined in\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0005>\nwhen the morphism is representable by algebraic spaces.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:20368a1e225864ee3710dec5ee32e53ea8c3b450e4cba0ce06c63d49a7466684", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06Q1:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8286f1d1b33900688d685796cec9f3e8e135cb5c072e116a379612440fa1794a", "hash": "sha256:8286f1d1b33900688d685796cec9f3e8e135cb5c072e116a379612440fa1794a", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 200416, "byte_start": 200279, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:164d4d3c496ccb9ead16fefcaaa637065e07829608f04c26bec606149a9b5950", "line_end": 5398, "line_start": 5396}, "owner_tag": "06Q1", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06Q1", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTBFCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTBFOPEN_0001": "{\\bf "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4f1d965ee85f9caabdfbad910b4520895923c38ceddc7efdbc92419ae381fcf3", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nNote that a morphism of finite presentation is <TEXTBFOPEN_0001>not<TEXTBFCLOSE_0001> just a quasi-compact\nmorphism which is locally of finite presentation.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9e23430c8b9340f41f769c799600e4eb00c90ab589d7fc9c0c71befb1edd153d", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06Q1:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "hash": "sha256:24de6fd4aa179792367dfd0387f1894956af7b103d6c0f74b2d0f13e5860b7d3", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 110543, "byte_start": 109279, "file": "stacks-morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:3d947fb3cd19e8423537311ed9adbf370b034046005b268644184dfe001f5a8d", "line_end": 3053, "line_start": 3023}, "owner_tag": "06FM", "parent_tag": "06FL", "requested_label": "stacks-morphisms-lemma-local-source-target", "requested_tag": "06FM", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06FL", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-local-source-target}", "MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0002": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d]_a \\ar[r]_h & V \\ar[d]^b \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]^f & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$V$", "MATH_0006": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} V$", "MATH_0007": "$h$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0009": "$a : U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0010": "$h$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0014": "$f$", "MATH_0015": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0016": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0017": "$f$", "MATH_0018": "$f$", "MATH_0019": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:21d3fd4d2f758f9fce4653914a822ca3045e36c98445eb734d0f4e0d67cd7612", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6c68f124a59818d764bd9bce57c862c39ec73f5f965a4906e46d9bf4052dbae6", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a property of morphisms of algebraic spaces\nwhich is smooth local on the source-and-target.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nConsider commutative diagrams\n<MATH_0003>\nwhere <MATH_0004> and <MATH_0005> are algebraic spaces and the vertical arrows are smooth.\nThe following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> for any diagram as above such that in addition\n<MATH_0006> is smooth\nthe morphism <MATH_0007> has property <MATH_0008>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> for some diagram as above with <MATH_0009> surjective\nthe morphism <MATH_0010> has property <MATH_0011>.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nIf <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013> are representable by algebraic spaces,\nthen this is also equivalent to <MATH_0014> (as a morphism of algebraic spaces)\nhaving property <MATH_0015>. If <MATH_0016> is also preserved under\nany base change, and fppf local on the base, then for morphisms <MATH_0017>\nwhich are representable by algebraic spaces this\nis also equivalent to <MATH_0018> having property <MATH_0019> in the sense\nof\nProperties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:01acdc55192e610ca824e9f704e788e529f66baf029ccdcaa3aaf15bf3910c57", "unit_id": "inventory:stacks-morphisms:06FM:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:5c7d53ecdc647a99a7f832f55299712ad64117a71f0a3ae76950a2b1cf736f02", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p046.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:3168101819890878ba2bc869b925d92e56efe6128c715356da9941fba5953132", "path": "docs/evidence/p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p046-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:9781e3aded0bc5f08d146ccda5f5a4edecfb97676acc8b4bfc06487a3a876eff"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:7c4e1984fe4e6b4ae37e01477744ca9f9a46294c", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p0-101-stacks-morphisms-p046", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a20c4d-8d5a-7463-b773-e65695d1a31a", "unit_id": "tag:06Q2:statement"}, "c